WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Separate the design plane from execution.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.920
A context adapter packages
approved source revisions.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:11.040
The model proposes a test patch,
and repository review produces an approved

00:00:11.109 --> 00:00:15.760
commit. A conventional runner executes
that commit against pinned resources.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:19.880
Raw results enter the evidence
store before AI prepares a summary.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.560
The quality owner then
assigns a disposition.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.080
The model is outside
the money-movement assertion path,

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.960
and its interpretation cannot
overwrite the original result.
